<title>DENMARK: Danish Kommunekredit adds 50 mln DKK to 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Danish Kommunekredit adds 50 mln DKK to 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish local authority lender Kommunekredit has raised its existing four percent 2002 bond issue by 50 million crowns, bringing the total to 2,058.815 million crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It  said the bonds had all been sold.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
